      "text": "Level-set on committee role and today’s purpose\nThe committee is advising the Board, not negotiating a single final policy text in one sitting.\nToday’s goal is to review the integrated draft package, identify what now reflects broad alignment, clarify which differences remain live, and decide what should be incorporated, preserved as alternatives, or carried forward explicitly as dissent."
